  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Fund for A Resilient Ukraine (PFRU)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Partnership Fund for a Resilient Ukraine (PFRU) is a multi-donor funded programme which strengthens the Ukrainian government&#x2019;s resilience against Russian aggression and delivers essential support to Ukrainian civil society, media, and the private sector. The programme has 4 strategic objectives: 1) Government resilience; 2) community stabilization; 3) strategic communications; and 4) economic opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
